          {
            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Via Qualtrics software, we distributed an online survey that contained the questionnaires mentioned above (SVC, CVC-q, NEI-VFQ-25, BRIEF-A, FEDA, DASS-21, SIMS). The majority of the sample (n=1,395) were recruited via Panel Inzicht, a company specialized in online quantitative research where participants receive a financial reward for participation. In order to determine the test-retest reliability of the SVC, a subset (n=66) of the total sample were recruited via other sources, including social media and via the distribution of flyers in university buildings, healthcare centers and supermarkets. These participants were invited to complete a subset of the questionnaires (i.e. SVC, BRIEF-A, SIMS) again after a period of two weeks."
            ]
          }
